  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## 12.4.0\n\nAdds to 12.3.1 and removes nothing. The line break, text change and undo changes in the `Avalonia.Controls.Documents` 12.4.0 notes apply to the editor as well.\n\n### Behavioural changes\n- Enter inside a code block (any block kind flagged `Preformatted`, such as a markdown fenced code block) inserts a line into the block. It split the block like a paragraph, and every line after the caret left the fence and was saved as ordinary text.\n- Shift+Enter inside a code block inserts the same line feed as Enter. It inserted `Environment.NewLine` as text, so on Windows a code block mixed CR LF into its LF lines.\n- A collapsed Backspace or Delete removes the whole grapheme next to the caret, as the caret steps over it. It removed one UTF-16 code unit, which left half of an emoji's surrogate pair behind.\n\n### Fixes\n- A collapsed Backspace or Delete at a block edge that cannot merge or unwrap stops there. It deleted the last character of the block before or the first of the block after: Backspace at the start of a section's first paragraph ate the end of the section above.\n- Undoing a collapsed Backspace or Delete at the start of a block that follows an empty paragraph puts the character back where it was. It went into the empty paragraph, or into a bold span before the caret.\n- Markdown headings, code blocks, task items and alerts edit like the blocks they extend: Backspace and Delete merge a heading or code block with a neighbouring paragraph, and Backspace at the start of a task item leaves the list.",
